  "title": "Roast Pumpkin & Chickpea Fattoush",
  "description": "We love fattoush; that Middle Eastern panzanella style salad studded with crispy shards of Lebanese bread and lemony sumac. There’s nothing quite like it! We’ve thrown everything we love about Middle Eastern cuisine into this celebratory dish: pumpkin, Kalamata olives and chickpeas. If you’ve got any in the house, a drizzle of tahini on this is divine as well!",
